======================================================================

Every subject, predicate, and object must contain at least one evidence item.

Each evidence quote must be an exact, non-empty substring of its declared
segment.

Preserve exactly:

- capitalization;
- punctuation;
- spelling;
- whitespace;
- hyphens;
- quotation marks;
